OL,14,G2032 Health Check
OL,15,     FThree months since the outbreak
OL,16,     Fwas declared more than 1,900
OL,17,     Fpeople have died from the virus,
OL,18,     Fwith more than 4200 confirmed
OL,19,     Fcases, making this the
OL,20,     Fsecond-worst Ebola outbreak ever.
