OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FDanny Nguyen escaped Vietnam for
OL,7,     Fthe US in the early 80s. After
OL,8,     Fwatching the dance movie Fame, he
OL,9,     Fdiscovered a hidden talent for
OL,10,     Fdance that would become his life
OL,11,     Fpassion.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1963, as Kenya gained
OL,14,     Findependence, one of the last Mau
OL,15,     FMau fighters came out of hiding
OL,16,     Fand laid down her arms. Muthoni
OL,17,     FKirima was the rebellion's only
OL,18,     Ffemale field marshall.
